{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>And HaShem opened the mouth of the ass.</b> He placed in her the power to speak, as in יהוה שְׂפָתַי תִּפְתָּח (Psalms 51:17). All this was in order that Balaam be stirred to return in repentance, reminding him that מֵיְהֹוָה מַעֲנֵה לָשׁוֹן (Proverbs 16:1) — even what is not prepared [to speak], all the more so can He remove from what is prepared at will. And all this was so that a man such as him should not perish."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:43.846967226Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}